[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://mgn4yar0d3vn" path="res://global/resources/wcag_data.gd" id="1_qbmxy"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_qbmxy")
id = "1.1.1"
title = "Non-Text Content"
short_description = "This criterion requires all meaningful non-text elements, such as images or icons, to include text alternatives that convey the same purpose or information."
long_description = "[b][u]OBJECTIVE[/u][/b]
The WCAG 2.1 success criterion 1.1.1 - Non-text Content ensures that users can access information presented through images, icons, charts, or other non-text elements.

[b][u]TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS[/u][/b]
[indent]
[b]•[/b] Meaningful non-text content must provide equivalent text alternatives, such as ARIA labels or 'alt' attributes.
[b]•[/b] These alternatives allow assistive technologies to communicate the same information to users.
[b]•[/b] The goal is to ensure content remains accessible regardless of how users perceive information.
[/indent]
[b][u]TIP[/u][/b]
Fix the code by providing a descriptive sentence in the 'alt' attribute. A good text alternative explains what the image depicts so that a screen reader can announce it correctly."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://mgn4yar0d3vn"
